---
const clubStats = [
  { value: '450+', label: 'program applications' },
  { value: '48', label: 'startups supported' },
  { value: '3', label: 'completed cohorts' },
];
---

<section id="about" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl scroll-mt-20 px-4 py-20 sm:px-6">
  <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand sm:text-4xl">About Startup Weekend Skopje</h2>
  <div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
    <p>
      For 14 years, Startup Weekend Skopje has been bringing together young innovators,
      entrepreneurs and changemakers in the heart of North Macedonia.
    </p>
    <p>
      Since its first edition in 2011, it has become an important part of the local startup
      ecosystem, a place where ideas become teams, teams become businesses, and new founders
      take their first step. Over the years, the Startup Weekend Skopje community has helped
      spark successful ventures such as <strong>Brainster</strong>, <strong>Ways2Help</strong>,
      <strong>Challenger</strong>, <strong>Air Care</strong> and others.
    </p>
    <p>
      In 2026, for its 14th edition, Startup Club Skopje officially takes over as the lead
      organizer, bringing its experience in youth entrepreneurship, startup programs and
      community building.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our mission is simple: to give the next generation the tools, connections and confidence
      to turn ideas into action.
    </p>
    <p class="font-medium text-brand">
      Because every startup starts somewhere.
      <em class="block">Sometimes, it starts in one weekend.</em>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-16 rounded-3xl bg-brand-light p-8 sm:p-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand sm:text-4xl">About Startup Club Skopje</h2>
    <div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
      <p>
        Startup Club Skopje is a non-governmental organization dedicated to strengthening and
        growing the startup ecosystem in North Macedonia. Founded in 2019 and actively building
        its community since 2023, Startup Club Skopje creates opportunities for young people,
        founders, freelancers and innovators to learn, connect and build.
      </p>
      <p>
        At the heart of its work is <strong>#ИмамИдеја</strong>, the country's only startup
        incubation program. With 450+ applications, three successfully completed cohorts and
        48 startups supported, the program continues to help turn early-stage ideas into real
        ventures, with the fourth cohort set to launch in late 2026.
      </p>
      <p>
        Beyond its programs, Startup Club Skopje brings the community together through its
        podcasts <em>Startup Revolution</em> and <em>The Freelancers Hangout</em>, an open and
        free coworking space, an event space, and a growing calendar of community events and
        initiatives.
      </p>
      <p>
        Startup Club Skopje is also the lead organizer of <strong>Startup Revolution AI
        Summit</strong>, bringing together founders, startups, investors, innovators and the
        wider tech community. In 2026, the second edition of the Summit is set to bring
        together 2,000+ participants in Skopje.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our mission is simple: build the community, create opportunities, and help the next
        generation build what's next.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 grid max-w-xl grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      {clubStats.map((stat) => (
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-accent-dark">{stat.value}</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-neutral-600">{stat.label}</div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
